<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97171" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρέμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is twisted, thread</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυππίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jd.</u>
					16.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>twist, roll</i>,= 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρεπτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wrench, stram, sprain</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἂν ῥῆγμα κἂν στρέμμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					2.21
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				11.14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.890
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>conspiracy, band of conspirators</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνέστρεψε στρέμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ki.</u>
					15.30
				</span></i>
			 (cod. B).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
